 class=\"films-list__by-title__title\" style=\"color: #215551;\">Browse all films A–Z </h2>\n      \n      \n\n        <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film\" style=\"background-image: url();\" id=\"starts-with-1\">\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-image\">\n                          <a\n              href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/101-dalmatians-1961/\"><img src=\"https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/GCL/5673145.jpg\" class=\"films-list__by-title__film-thumb\" alt=\"\"></a>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-content\">\n            <h2\n              class=\"films-list__by-title__film-title\"><a  href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/101-dalmatians-1961/\">101 Dalmatians (1961) <span class=\"film-detail__film__rating\">U</span></a></h2>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__az-summary\">\n              <em>Clyde Geronimi, Hamilton Luske, Wolfgang Reitherman</em></div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__synopsis\">\n                                The classic cartoon version of the children's story by Dodie Smith. Pongo and Perdita are two dogs leading a happy life in London together- they have successfully paired up their owners, and have recently become the proud parents of 15 adorable puppies.&hellip; <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/101-dalmatians-1961/\">Read&nbsp;More</a>            </div>\n\n            <span class=\"films-list__by-title__screenings\">\n                  <div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel   pay_what_you_can \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Sat 08 Aug</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5673596.TcsSection_3060731\">11:00</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-pay_what_you_can\"></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n      </div></div></div><div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel   pay_what_you_can \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Sun 09 Aug</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5673598.TcsSection_3060731\">11:00</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-pay_what_you_can\"></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n      </div></div></div><div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel   pay_what_you_can \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Wed 12 Aug</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5673658.TcsSection_971\">11:00</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-pay_what_you_can\"></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n      </div></div></div>              </span>\n          </div>\n\n\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film\" style=\"background-image: url();\" id=\"starts-with-a\">\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-image\">\n                          <a\n              href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/ackroyd-harvey-the-art-of-activism/\"><img src=\"https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/GCL/5742376.jpg\" class=\"films-list__by-title__film-thumb\" alt=\"\"></a>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-content\">\n            <h2\n              class=\"films-list__by-title__film-title\"><a  href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/ackroyd-harvey-the-art-of-activism/\">Ackroyd &amp; Harvey: The Art of Activism <span class=\"film-detail__film__rating\">12A</span></a></h2>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__az-summary\">\n              <em>Fiona Cunningham-Reid, 2024, UK</em></div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__synopsis\">\n                                The screening will be introduced by the director. When does practice become protest, or art, activism?   Award-winning documentary filmmaker Fiona Cunningham-Reid presents an intimate portrait of internationally acclaimed artists Heather Ackroyd and Dan Harvey, who work at the intersection of art,&hellip; <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/ackroyd-harvey-the-art-of-activism/\">Read&nbsp;More</a>            </div>\n\n            <span class=\"films-list__by-title__screenings\">\n                  <div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel  \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Mon 20 Jul</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5742397.TcsSection_971\">18:00</a></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n      </div></div></div>              </span>\n          </div>\n\n\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film\" style=\"background-image: url();\" >\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-image\">\n                          <a\n              href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/adams-rib/\"><img src=\"https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/GCL/5452731.jpg\" class=\"films-list__by-title__film-thumb\" alt=\"\"></a>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-content\">\n            <h2\n              class=\"films-list__by-title__film-title\"><a  href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/adams-rib/\">Adam's Rib <span class=\"film-detail__film__rating\">U</span></a></h2>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__az-summary\">\n              <em>George Cukor/ 1949/ USA</em></div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__synopsis\">\n                                A courtroom rivalry finds its way into the household when prosecuting lawyer Adam Bonner (Spencer Tracy) faces off against his wife, Amanda (Katharine Hepburn), who happens to be a defence attorney. Working on opposite sides of a lawsuit where a woman (Judy&hellip; <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/adams-rib/\">Read&nbsp;More</a>            </div>\n\n            <span class=\"films-list__by-title__screenings\">\n                  <div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel  \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Sun 19 Jul</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5414172.TcsSection_638\">13:00</a></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n      </div></div></div>              </span>\n          </div>\n\n\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film\" style=\"background-image: url();\" >\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-image\">\n                          <a\n              href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/all-about-ah-long/\"><img src=\"https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/GCL/5772648.jpg\" class=\"films-list__by-title__film-thumb\" alt=\"\"></a>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-content\">\n            <h2\n              class=\"films-list__by-title__film-title\"><a  href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/all-about-ah-long/\">All About Ah-Long <span class=\"film-detail__film__rating\">18</span></a></h2>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__az-summary\">\n              <em>Johnnie To, 1989, Hong Kong</em></div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__synopsis\">\n                                The screening on 20 August will be introduced by James Mudge, the Festival Director of Focus Hong Kong. All About Ah-Long was one of the biggest box-office successes of its year and remains one of the most beloved films in Johnnie To’s filmography.&hellip; <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/all-about-ah-long/\">Read&nbsp;More</a>            </div>\n\n            <span class=\"films-list__by-title__screenings\">\n                  <div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel   intro \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Thu 20 Aug</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5713075.TcsSection_638\">18:00</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-intro\"></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n      </div></div></div>              </span>\n          </div>\n\n\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film\" style=\"background-image: url();\" >\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-image\">\n                          <a\n              href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/as-tears-go-by/\"><img src=\"https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/GCL/5710656.jpg\" class=\"films-list__by-title__film-thumb\" alt=\"\"></a>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-content\">\n            <h2\n              class=\"films-list__by-title__film-title\"><a  href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/as-tears-go-by/\">As Tears Go By <span class=\"film-detail__film__rating\">18</span></a></h2>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__az-summary\">\n              <em>Wong Kar-wai, 1988, Hong Kong</em></div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__synopsis\">\n                                As Tears Go By marks the directorial debut of Wong Kar-wai, and was inspired by Martin Scorsese's Mean Streets (1973), though it remains an atypical entry within Wong’s filmography. At a time when gangster films dominated the Hong Kong box office, particularly following the&hellip; <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/as-tears-go-by/\">Read&nbsp;More</a>            </div>\n\n            <span class=\"films-list__by-title__screenings\">\n                  <div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel  \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Thu 23 Jul</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5731320.TcsSection_638\">18:15</a></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n      </div></div></div>              </span>\n          </div>\n\n\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film\" style=\"background-image: url();\" >\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-image\">\n                          <a\n              href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/autumn-moon/\"><img src=\"https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/GCL/5710668.jpg\" class=\"films-list__by-title__film-thumb\" alt=\"\"></a>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-content\">\n            <h2\n              class=\"films-list__by-title__film-title\"><a  href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/autumn-moon/\">Autumn Moon <span class=\"film-detail__film__rating\">18</span></a></h2>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__az-summary\">\n              <em>Clara Law, 1992, Hong Kong, Japan</em></div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__synopsis\">\n                                The screening on 15 August will be introduced by Ching Wong, curator of Forever Foreigner: The Films of Clara Law film series and Programme Director of Hong Kong Festival UK.  Autumn Moon, winner of the Golden Leopard at the 1992 Locarno Film Festival, is&hellip; <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/autumn-moon/\">Read&nbsp;More</a>            </div>\n\n            <span class=\"films-list__by-title__screenings\">\n                  <div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel   intro \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Sat 15 Aug</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5712889.TcsSection_638\">17:45</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-intro\"></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n      </div></div></div>              </span>\n          </div>\n\n\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film\" style=\"background-image: url();\" >\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-image\">\n                          <a\n              href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/an-autumns-tale/\"><img src=\"https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/GCL/5710625.jpg\" class=\"films-list__by-title__film-thumb\" alt=\"\"></a>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-content\">\n            <h2\n              class=\"films-list__by-title__film-title\"><a  href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/an-autumns-tale/\">An Autumn's Tale <span class=\"film-detail__film__rating\">15</span></a></h2>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__az-summary\">\n              <em>Mabel Cheung, 1987, Hong Kong</em></div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__synopsis\">\n                                The screening on 20 July will be introduced by Tom Cunliffe (UCL). Presented in the restored version. An Autumn’s Tale, the second instalment of Mabel Cheung’s acclaimed 'Migration Trilogy' (along with The Illegal Immigrant and Eight Taels of Gold),  was created in collaboration&hellip; <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/an-autumns-tale/\">Read&nbsp;More</a>            </div>\n\n            <span class=\"films-list__by-title__screenings\">\n                  <div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel   intro \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Mon 20 Jul</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5711844.TcsSection_638\">19:00</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-intro\"></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n      </div></div></div><div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel  \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Sun 09 Aug</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5734619.TcsSection_3060731\">16:30</a></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n      </div></div></div>              </span>\n          </div>\n\n\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film\" style=\"background-image: url();\" >\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-image\">\n                          <a\n              href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/the-awful-truth/\"><img src=\"https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/GCL/5390383.jpg\" class=\"films-list__by-title__film-thumb\" alt=\"\"></a>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-content\">\n            <h2\n              class=\"films-list__by-title__film-title\"><a  href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/the-awful-truth/\">The Awful Truth <span class=\"film-detail__film__rating\">U</span></a></h2>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__az-summary\">\n              <em>Leo McCarey, 1937, USA</em></div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__synopsis\">\n                                In this Oscar-winning farce, Cary Grant (in the role that first defined the Cary Grant persona) and Irene Dunne exude charm, cunning, and artless affection as an urbane couple who, fed up with each other’s infidelities, resolve to file for divorce. But&hellip; <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/the-awful-truth/\">Read&nbsp;More</a>            </div>\n\n            <span class=\"films-list__by-title__screenings\">\n                  <div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel  \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Sat 08 Aug</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5414232.TcsSection_638\">18:00</a></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n      </div></div></div>              </span>\n          </div>\n\n\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film\" style=\"background-image: url();\" id=\"starts-with-b\">\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-image\">\n                          <a\n              href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/bhowani-junction-70th-anniversary/\"><img src=\"https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/GCL/5562674.jpg\" class=\"films-list__by-title__film-thumb\" alt=\"\"></a>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-content\">\n            <h2\n              class=\"films-list__by-title__film-title\"><a  href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/bhowani-junction-70th-anniversary/\">Bhowani Junction: 70th Anniversary <span class=\"film-detail__film__rating\">18</span></a></h2>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__az-summary\">\n              <em>George Cukor, 1956, USA</em></div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__synopsis\">\n                                The 70th anniversary screenings will be preceded by a pre-recorded introduction by guest curator Anupma Shanker. Based on the 1954 novel of the same name by the British army officer & novelist John Masters, and directed by the Oscar winning filmmaker George&hellip; <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/bhowani-junction-70th-anniversary/\">Read&nbsp;More</a>            </div>\n\n            <span class=\"films-list__by-title__screenings\">\n                  <div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel   intro \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Sun 12 Jul</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5629080.TcsSection_971\">16:30</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-intro\"></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n      </div></div></div><div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel   intro \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Fri 17 Jul</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5629086.TcsSection_971\">14:00</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-intro\"></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n      </div></div></div>              </span>\n          </div>\n\n\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film\" style=\"background-image: url();\" >\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-image\">\n                          <a\n              href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/blue-heron/\"><img src=\"https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/GCL/5713631.jpg\" class=\"films-list__by-title__film-thumb\" alt=\"\"></a>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-content\">\n            <h2\n              class=\"films-list__by-title__film-title\"><a  href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/blue-heron/\">Blue Heron <span class=\"film-detail__film__rating\">12A</span></a></h2>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__az-summary\">\n              <em>Sophy Romvari, 2025, Canada, Hungary</em></div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__synopsis\">\n                                Our 15:00 screening on Saturday 27 June will be followed by an in-person Q&A with director Sophy Romvari. Set on Vancouver Island in the late 1990s, Blue Heron follows eight-year-old Sasha and her Hungarian immigrant family as they attempt to build a new&hellip; <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/blue-heron/\">Read&nbsp;More</a>            </div>\n\n            <span class=\"films-list__by-title__screenings\">\n                  <div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel  \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Sat 11 Jul</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5835648.TcsSection_971\">20:30</a></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n      </div></div></div><div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel  \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Sun 12 Jul</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5835667.TcsSection_3060731\">17:30</a></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n      </div></div></div><div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel  \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Wed 15 Jul</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5835703.TcsSection_971\">15:45</a></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n      </div></div></div><div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel  \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Thu 16 Jul</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5835725.TcsSection_971\">19:45</a></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n      </div></div></div>              </span>\n          </div>\n\n\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film\" style=\"background-image: url();\" >\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-image\">\n                          <a\n              href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/bringing-up-baby/\"><img src=\"https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/GCL/5390428.jpg\" class=\"films-list__by-title__film-thumb\" alt=\"\"></a>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-content\">\n            <h2\n              class=\"films-list__by-title__film-title\"><a  href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/bringing-up-baby/\">Bringing Up Baby <span class=\"film-detail__film__rating\">U</span></a></h2>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__az-summary\">\n              <em>Howard Hawks, 1938, USA</em></div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__synopsis\">\n                                No synopsis can do it justice: Cary Grant plays a stuffy palaeontologist who meets the anarchically free-spirited Katharine Hepburn. She has a pet leopard (the titular Baby, seamlessly inserted into scenes where one swipe of claws could have ended a Hollywood heart-throb's&hellip; <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/bringing-up-baby/\">Read&nbsp;More</a>            </div>\n\n            <span class=\"films-list__by-title__screenings\">\n                  <div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel  \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Wed 12 Aug</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5414240.TcsSection_3060731\">20:15</a></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n      </div></div></div>              </span>\n          </div>\n\n\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film\" style=\"background-image: url();\" >\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-image\">\n                          <a\n              href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/broadcast-news/\"><img src=\"https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/GCL/5710849.jpg\" class=\"films-list__by-title__film-thumb\" alt=\"\"></a>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-content\">\n            <h2\n              class=\"films-list__by-title__film-title\"><a  href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/broadcast-news/\">Broadcast News <span class=\"film-detail__film__rating\">15</span></a></h2>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__az-summary\">\n              <em>James L. Brooks, 1987, USA</em></div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__synopsis\">\n                                Broadcast News was suggested by our member John Atkinson, who writes: 'Broadcast News is the sort of nuanced comedy drama that studios run a mile from these days. It’s wonderfully written, full of great dialogue delivered by a perfect cast. It’s one of my&hellip; <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/broadcast-news/\">Read&nbsp;More</a>            </div>\n\n            <span class=\"films-list__by-title__screenings\">\n                  <div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel  \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Fri 07 Aug</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5770789.TcsSection_638\">15:30</a></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n      </div></div></div><div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel  \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Sat 29 Aug</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5731160.TcsSection_638\">17:30</a></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n      </div></div></div>              </span>\n          </div>\n\n\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film\" style=\"background-image: url();\" >\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-image\">\n                          <a\n              href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/bugsy-malone/\"><img width=\"448\" height=\"600\" src=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/films/Bugsy-Malone.jpg\" class=\"films-list__by-title__film-thumb\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/films/Bugsy-Malone.jpg 448w, https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/films/Bugsy-Malone-368x493.jpg 368w, https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/films/Bugsy-Malone-224x300.jpg 224w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 448px) 100vw, 448px\" /></a>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-content\">\n            <h2\n              class=\"films-list__by-title__film-title\"><a  href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/bugsy-malone/\">Bugsy Malone- 50th anniversary <span class=\"film-detail__film__rating\">U</span></a></h2>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__az-summary\">\n              <em></em></div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__synopsis\">\n                                Alan Parker’s BAFTA-winning ganster musical Bugsy Malone celebrates it's 50th anniversary this year. Taking place during the Prohibition era it playfully spoofs the real-life mob wars with a very believable cast of young teens playing the would-be hoodlums, showgirls, and dreamers, including a&hellip; <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/bugsy-malone/\">Read&nbsp;More</a>            </div>\n\n            <span class=\"films-list__by-title__screenings\">\n                  <div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel   pay_what_you_can \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Sat 18 Jul</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5525443.TcsSection_3060731\">11:00</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-pay_what_you_can\"></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n      </div></div></div><div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel   pay_what_you_can \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Sun 19 Jul</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5525458.TcsSection_3060731\">11:00</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-pay_what_you_can\"></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n      </div></div></div><div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel   pay_what_you_can \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Wed 22 Jul</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5607493.TcsSection_638\">12:00</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-pay_what_you_can\"></spa