1 Aug</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5731078.TcsSection_638\">15:00</a></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n      </div></div></div>              </span>\n          </div>\n\n\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film\" style=\"background-image: url();\" id=\"starts-with-c\">\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-image\">\n                          <a\n              href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/cactus-pears/\"><img src=\"https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/GCL/5629645.jpg\" class=\"films-list__by-title__film-thumb\" alt=\"\"></a>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-content\">\n            <h2\n              class=\"films-list__by-title__film-title\"><a  href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/cactus-pears/\">Cactus Pears <span class=\"film-detail__film__rating\">15</span></a></h2>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__az-summary\">\n              <em>Rohan Parashuram Kanawade, 2025, India, UK, Canada</em></div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__synopsis\">\n                                Set in rural Maharashtra, Cactus Pears follows Anand (Bhushaan Manoj), a Mumbai call-centre worker who returns to his ancestral village to observe the ten-day mourning ritual following his father’s death. While navigating the pressures of family expectations and marriage, he reconnects with Balya&hellip; <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/cactus-pears/\">Read&nbsp;More</a>            </div>\n\n            <span class=\"films-list__by-title__screenings\">\n                  <div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel  \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Sun 12 Jul</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5835665.TcsSection_3060731\">15:00</a></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n      </div></div></div><div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel  \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Thu 16 Jul</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5835727.TcsSection_3060731\">18:15</a></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n      </div></div></div>              </span>\n          </div>\n\n\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film\" style=\"background-image: url();\" >\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-image\">\n                          <a\n              href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/center-stage/\"><img src=\"https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/GCL/5710605.jpg\" class=\"films-list__by-title__film-thumb\" alt=\"\"></a>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-content\">\n            <h2\n              class=\"films-list__by-title__film-title\"><a  href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/center-stage/\">Center Stage <span class=\"film-detail__film__rating\">18</span></a></h2>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__az-summary\">\n              <em>Stanley Kwan, 1991, Hong Kong</em></div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__synopsis\">\n                                The screening on 22 August will be introduced by Prof Chris Berry (KCL). Presented in the restored Director's Cut version. Center Stage marks the fourth collaboration between Stanley Kwan and renowned screenwriter Chiu Kang-chien, following Love Unto Waste (1986), Rouge (1987), and Full Moon&hellip; <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/center-stage/\">Read&nbsp;More</a>            </div>\n\n            <span class=\"films-list__by-title__screenings\">\n                  <div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel  \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Sun 02 Aug</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5711706.TcsSection_638\">13:45</a></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n      </div></div></div><div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel   intro \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Sat 22 Aug</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5711719.TcsSection_638\">20:00</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-intro\"></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n      </div></div></div>              </span>\n          </div>\n\n\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film\" style=\"background-image: url();\" >\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-image\">\n                          <a\n              href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/a-chinese-ghost-story/\"><img src=\"https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/GCL/5710814.jpg\" class=\"films-list__by-title__film-thumb\" alt=\"\"></a>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-content\">\n            <h2\n              class=\"films-list__by-title__film-title\"><a  href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/a-chinese-ghost-story/\">A Chinese Ghost Story <span class=\"film-detail__film__rating\">15</span></a></h2>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__az-summary\">\n              <em>Ching Siu-Tung, 1987, Hong Kong</em></div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__synopsis\">\n                                The screening on 24 July will be introduced by Andrew Henskins, film critic and founder of easternKicks.com. Presented in a newly restored version. A Chinese Ghost Story is the landmark collaboration between director Ching Siu-tung and producer Tsui Hark, whose creative partnership would&hellip; <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/a-chinese-ghost-story/\">Read&nbsp;More</a>            </div>\n\n            <span class=\"films-list__by-title__screenings\">\n                  <div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel   intro sold-out \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Fri 24 Jul</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5713018.TcsSection_638\">20:15</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-intro\"></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n    <h4 class=\"\" data-name=\"A Chinese Ghost Story\" data-datetime=\"Fri 24 Jul 20:15\" data-id=\"25771\"><span style=\"color:#C00;  margin-right: 3px;\" >SOLD OUT</span>&ndash; <a href=\"/login\" title=\"Members – login to add yourself to the waiting list\">Members: login to join waiting list</a></h4>  </div></div></div><div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel  \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Sun 16 Aug</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5713044.TcsSection_638\">15:00</a></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n      </div></div></div>              </span>\n          </div>\n\n\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film\" style=\"background-image: url();\" >\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-image\">\n                          <a\n              href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/a-chinese-ghost-story-ii/\"><img src=\"https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/GCL/5840233.jpg\" class=\"films-list__by-title__film-thumb\" alt=\"\"></a>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-content\">\n            <h2\n              class=\"films-list__by-title__film-title\"><a  href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/a-chinese-ghost-story-ii/\">A Chinese Ghost Story II <span class=\"film-detail__film__rating\">12</span></a></h2>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__az-summary\">\n              <em>Ching Siu-Tung, 1990, Hong Kong</em></div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__synopsis\">\n                                UK Premiere of the restoration. In Cantonese with English subtitles. A Chinese Ghost Story II is the second chapter of the landmark trilogy (along with the original film and A Chinese Ghost Story III), reuniting the iconic pairing of Leslie Cheung and Joey Wong.&hellip; <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/a-chinese-ghost-story-ii/\">Read&nbsp;More</a>            </div>\n\n            <span class=\"films-list__by-title__screenings\">\n                  <div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel  \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Sun 26 Jul</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5840325.TcsSection_638\">19:00</a></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n      </div></div></div><div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel  \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Fri 31 Jul</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5840396.TcsSection_638\">15:00</a></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n      </div></div></div>              </span>\n          </div>\n\n\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film\" style=\"background-image: url();\" >\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-image\">\n                          <a\n              href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/a-chinese-ghost-story-iii/\"><img src=\"https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/GCL/5840250.jpg\" class=\"films-list__by-title__film-thumb\" alt=\"\"></a>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-content\">\n            <h2\n              class=\"films-list__by-title__film-title\"><a  href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/a-chinese-ghost-story-iii/\">A Chinese Ghost Story III <span class=\"film-detail__film__rating\">15</span></a></h2>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__az-summary\">\n              <em>Ching Siu-Tung, 1991, Hong Kong</em></div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__synopsis\">\n                                UK Premiere of the restoration. In Cantonese with English subtitles. A Chinese Ghost Story III is the final installment of the trilogy (along with the original film and A Chinese Ghost Story II), and its most exuberant and playful entry, reuniting director Ching Siu-tung&hellip; <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/a-chinese-ghost-story-iii/\">Read&nbsp;More</a>            </div>\n\n            <span class=\"films-list__by-title__screenings\">\n                  <div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel  \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Tue 28 Jul</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5840414.TcsSection_3060731\">20:30</a></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n      </div></div></div><div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel  \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Tue 11 Aug</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5840442.TcsSection_638\">16:00</a></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n      </div></div></div>              </span>\n          </div>\n\n\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film\" style=\"background-image: url();\" >\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-image\">\n                          <a\n              href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/the-christophers/\"><img src=\"https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/GCL/5449196.jpg\" class=\"films-list__by-title__film-thumb\" alt=\"\"></a>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-content\">\n            <h2\n              class=\"films-list__by-title__film-title\"><a  href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/the-christophers/\">The Christophers <span class=\"film-detail__film__rating\">15</span></a></h2>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__az-summary\">\n              <em>Steven Soderbergh, 2025, UK, USA</em></div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__synopsis\">\n                                A mainstay of the London art scene since his starry breakout in the creative explosion of the 1960’s, Julian Sklar (Ian McKellen) has drifted into a cluttered, self?imposed seclusion. His two estranged children (James Corden, Jessica Gunning) enlist Lori (Michaela Coel), a&hellip; <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/the-christophers/\">Read&nbsp;More</a>            </div>\n\n            <span class=\"films-list__by-title__screenings\">\n                  <div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel   audio_description \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Wed 15 Jul</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5835701.TcsSection_3060731\">15:30</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-audio_description\"></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n      </div></div></div>              </span>\n          </div>\n\n\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film\" style=\"background-image: url();\" >\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-image\">\n                          <a\n              href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/chungking-express/\"><img src=\"https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/GCL/5710576.jpg\" class=\"films-list__by-title__film-thumb\" alt=\"\"></a>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-content\">\n            <h2\n              class=\"films-list__by-title__film-title\"><a  href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/chungking-express/\">Chungking Express <span class=\"film-detail__film__rating\">12</span></a></h2>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__az-summary\">\n              <em>Wong Kar-wai, 1994, Hong Kong</em></div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__synopsis\">\n                                More than three decades after its release, Chungking Express remains one of Wong Kar-wai’s most beloved and influential works, representing perhaps the fullest expression of his celebrated use of popular music. Starring some of the most iconic actors of 1990s Hong Kong cinema,&hellip; <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/chungking-express/\">Read&nbsp;More</a>            </div>\n\n            <span class=\"films-list__by-title__screenings\">\n                  <div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel  \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Thu 30 Jul</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5713187.TcsSection_638\">15:00</a></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n      </div></div></div>              </span>\n          </div>\n\n\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film\" style=\"background-image: url();\" id=\"starts-with-d\">\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-image\">\n                          <a\n              href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/days-and-nights-in-the-forest-4k-restoration-pre-recorded-introduction-by-wes-anderson/\"><img src=\"https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/GCL/5453013.jpg\" class=\"films-list__by-title__film-thumb\" alt=\"\"></a>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-content\">\n            <h2\n              class=\"films-list__by-title__film-title\"><a  href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/days-and-nights-in-the-forest-4k-restoration-pre-recorded-introduction-by-wes-anderson/\">Days and Nights in the Forest: New Restoration + Pre-recorded introduction by Wes Anderson <span class=\"film-detail__film__rating\">PG</span></a></h2>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__az-summary\">\n              <em>Satyajit Ray, India, 1970</em></div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__synopsis\">\n                                Days and Nights in the Forest was suggested by our members Dennis Leachman and Hammad Khan. Hammad writes: ‘This is an absolute classic from Satyajit Ray, featuring regular Ray muse Soumitra Chatterjee and iconic Indian star Sharmila Tagore. I first saw it&hellip; <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/days-and-nights-in-the-forest-4k-restoration-pre-recorded-introduction-by-wes-anderson/\">Read&nbsp;More</a>            </div>\n\n            <span class=\"films-list__by-title__screenings\">\n                  <div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel   intro  free_members  members sold-out \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Thu 16 Jul</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5784492.TcsSection_638\">18:00</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-intro\"></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-free_members\"></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-members\"></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n    <h4 class=\"\" data-name=\"Days and Nights in the Forest: New Restoration + Pre-recorded introduction by Wes Anderson\" data-datetime=\"Thu 16 Jul 18:00\" data-id=\"26109\"><span style=\"color:#C00;  margin-right: 3px;\" >SOLD OUT</span>&ndash; <a href=\"/login\" title=\"Members – login to add yourself to the waiting list\">Members: login to join waiting list</a></h4>  </div></div></div><div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel   intro sold-out \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Tue 21 Jul</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5629148.TcsSection_3060731\">20:00</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-intro\"></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n    <h4 class=\"\" data-name=\"Days and Nights in the Forest: New Restoration + Pre-recorded introduction by Wes Anderson\" data-datetime=\"Tue 21 Jul 20:00\" data-id=\"25384\"><span style=\"color:#C00;  margin-right: 3px;\" >SOLD OUT</span>&ndash; <a href=\"/login\" title=\"Members – login to add yourself to the waiting list\">Members: login to join waiting list</a></h4>  </div></div></div>              </span>\n          </div>\n\n\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film\" style=\"background-image: url();\" >\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-image\">\n                          <a\n              href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/dear-you/\"><img src=\"https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/GCL/5735870.jpg\" class=\"films-list__by-title__film-thumb\" alt=\"\"></a>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-content\">\n            <h2\n              class=\"films-list__by-title__film-title\"><a  href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/dear-you/\">Dear You <span class=\"film-detail__film__rating\">15</span></a></h2>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__az-summary\">\n              <em>Lan Hongchun, 2026, China</em></div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__synopsis\">\n                                For years, Grandma Shurou from Chaoshan has lived on the letters and remittances from her husband who left for Nanyang to survive the war and never returned. When her debt-ridden grandson Xiaowei secretly travels to Thailand to find his rumoured 'millionaire' grandpa,&hellip; <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/dear-you/\">Read&nbsp;More</a>            </div>\n\n            <span class=\"films-list__by-title__screenings\">\n                  <div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel  \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Sat 11 Jul</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5835652.TcsSection_638\">18:00</a></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n      </div></div></div><div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel  \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Sun 12 Jul</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5835673.TcsSection_638\">14:30</a></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n      </div></div></div><div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel  \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Tue 14 Jul</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5835689.TcsSection_3060731\">17:45</a></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n      </div></div></div><div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel  \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Thu 16 Jul</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5835723.TcsSection_638\">15:15</a></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n      </div></div><div class=\"screening-panel  \"><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5835729.TcsSection_3060731\">20:50</a></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n      </div></div></div>              </span>\n          </div>\n\n\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film\" style=\"background-image: url();\" >\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-image\">\n                          <a\n              href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/desperately-seeking-susan/\"><img src=\"https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/GCL/5710871.jpg\" class=\"films-list__by-title__film-thumb\" alt=\"\"></a>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-content\">\n            <h2\n              class=\"films-list__by-title__film-title\"><a  href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/desperately-seeking-susan/\">Desperately Seeking Susan <span class=\"film-detail__film__rating\">15</span></a></h2>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__az-summary\">\n              <em>Susan Seidelman, 1985, USA</em></div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__synopsis\">\n                                Desperately Seeking Susan was suggested by our member Christopher Voisey, who writes: A film that will forever mean late-summer ’85. Madonna and Rosanna lead their men through an enchanted NYC - a life-affirming film of living your life and getting Into the Groove.'&hellip; <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/desperately-seeking-susan/\">Read&nbsp;More</a>            </div>\n\n            <span class=\"films-list__by-title__screenings\">\n                  <div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel  \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Sun 02 Aug</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5731253.TcsSection_3060731\">16:00</a></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n      </div></div></div>              </span>\n          </div>\n\n\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film\" style=\"background-image: url();\" id=\"starts-with-e\">\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-image\">\n                          <a\n              href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/eight-taels-of-gold-2/\"><img src=\"https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/GCL/5710644.jpg\" class=\"films-list__by-title__film-thumb\" alt=\"\"></a>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-content\">\n            <h2\n              class=\"films-list__by-title__film-title\"><a  href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/eight-taels-of-gold-2/\">Eight Taels of Gold <span class=\"film-detail__film__rating\">18</span></a></h2>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__az-summary\">\n              <em>Mabel Cheung, 1989, Hong Kong</em></div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__synopsis\">\n                                The screening on 22 July will be introduced by the season curator Millie Zhou. Eight Taels of Gold concludes Mabel Cheung’s celebrated 'Migration Trilogy,' extending her and longtime screenwriting partner Alex Law’s exploration of migration from departure and settlement to the question of&hellip; <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/eight-taels-of-gold-2/\">Read&nbsp;More</a>            </div>\n\n            <span class=\"films-list__by-title__screenings\">\n                  <div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel   intro \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Wed 22 Jul</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5711888.TcsSection_638\">18:30</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-intro\"></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n      </div></div></div><div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel  \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Mon 10 Aug</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5712536.TcsSection_638\">20:00</a></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n      </div></div></div>              </span>\n          </div>\n\n\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film\" style=\"background-image: url();\" id=\"starts-with-f\">\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-image\">\n                          <a\n              href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/figures-in-a-landscape/\"><img src=\"https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/GCL/5733988.jpg\" class=\"films-list__by-title__film-thumb\" alt=\"\"></a>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-content\">\n            <h2\n              class=\"films-list__by-title__film-title\"><a  href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/figures-in-a-landscape/\">Figures in a Landscape <span class=\"film-detail__film__rating\">15</span></a></h2>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__az-summary\">\n              <em>Joseph Losey, 1970, UK, Spain, USA</em></div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__synopsis\">\n                                This edition of Composing Cinema celebrates the experimental musician and three-time Oscar nominated composer Richard Rodney Bennett's score for Joseph Losey's unique (and rarely screened) Figures in a Landscape. The screening will be introduced by regular host, the Oscar nominated composer Gary&hellip; <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/figures-in-a-landscape/\">Read&nbsp;More</a>            </div>\n\n            <span class=\"films-list__by-title__screenings\">\n                  <div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel   intro \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Thu 30 Jul</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5734001.TcsSection_638\">19:45</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-intro\"></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n      </div></div></div>              </span>\n          </div>\n\n\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film\" style=\"background-image: url();\" >\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-image\">\n                          <a\n              href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/free-willy/\"><img src=\"https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/GCL/5672588.jpg\" class=\"films-list__by-title__film-thumb\" alt=\"\"></a>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-content\">\n            <h2\n              class=\"films-list__by-title__film-title\"><a  href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/free-willy/\">Free Willy <span class=\"film-detail__film__rating\">PG</span></a></h2>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__az-summary\">\n              <em>Simon Wincer, 1993, USA</em></div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__synopsis\">\n                                In this much-loved family classic, a 12-year-old orphaned boy named Jesse befriends a captive orca, Willy, at an ailing amusement park. When he discovers that the park owner has been planning to dispose of Willy, he hatches a scheme to break Willy&hellip; <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/free-willy/\">Read&nbsp;More</a>            </div>\n\n            <span class=\"films-list__by-title__screenings\">\n                  <div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel   pay_what_you_can \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Sat 19 Sep</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5672884.TcsSection_3060731\">11:00</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-pay_what_you_can\"></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n      </div></div></div><div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel   pay_what_you_can \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Sun 20 Sep</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5672886.TcsSection_638\">11:00</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-pay_what_you_can\"></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n      </div></div></div>              </span>\n          </div>\n\n\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film\" style=\"background-image: url();\" >\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-image\">\n                          <a\n              href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/full-moon-in-new-york-qa/\"><img src=\"https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/GCL/5710584.jpg\" class=\"films-list__by-title__film-thumb\" alt=\"\"></a>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-content\">\n            <h2\n              class=\"films-list__by-title__film-title\"><a  href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/full-moon-in-new-york-qa/\">Full Moon in New York <span class=\"film-detail__film__rating\">15</span></a></h2>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__az-summary\">\n              <em>Stanley Kwan, 1989, Hong Kong</em></div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__synopsis\">\n                                The screening on 25 August will be followed by an in-person Q&A with the director Stanley Kwan, moderated by Prof Victor Fan (KCL). Full Moon in New York is a unique work within Stanley Kwan’s filmography and remains his only feature set primarily&hellip; <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/full-moon-in-new-york-qa/\">Read&nbsp;More</a>            </div>\n\n            <span class=\"films-list__by-title__screenings\">\n                  <div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel  \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Sat 01 Aug</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5711660.TcsSection_638\">15:30</a></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n      </div></div></div><div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel   q_and_a sold-out \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Tue 25 Aug</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5711684.TcsSection_638\">17:30</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-q_and_a\"></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n    <h4 class=\"\" data-name=\"Full Moon in New York\" data-datetime=\"Tue 25 Aug 17:30\" data-id=\"25747\"><span style=\"color:#C00;  margin-right: 3px;\" >SOLD OUT</span>&ndash; <a href=\"/login\" title=\"Members – login to add yourself to the waiting list\">Members: login to join waiting list</a></h4>  </div></div></div>              </span>\n          </div>\n\n\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film\" style=\"background-image: url();\" id=\"starts-with-g\">\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-image\">\n                          <a\n              href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/the-girls-gehenu-lamai/\"><img src=\"https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/GCL/5562789.jpg\" class=\"films-list__by-title__film-thumb\" alt=\"\"></a>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-content\">\n            <h2\n              class=\"films-list__by-title__film-title\"><a  href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/the-girls-gehenu-lamai/\">The Girls (Gehenu Lamai): New Restoration <span class=\"film-detail__film__rating\">18</span></a></h2>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__az-summary\">\n              <em>Sumitra Peries, Sri Lanka, 1978</em></div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__synopsis\">\n                                Courtesy of the High Commission of Sri Lanka, London, our screening on Monday 27 July will be preceded by a drinks reception in the Atrium Bar from 18:30. Ticketholders will receive a complimentary glass of Sri Lanka's national spirit, Ceylon Arrack, mixed&hellip; <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/the-girls-gehenu-lamai/\">Read&nbsp;More</a>            </div>\n\n            <span class=\"films-list__by-title__screenings\">\n                  <div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel   intro sold-out \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Mon 27 Jul</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5629190.TcsSection_3060731\">19:30</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-intro\"></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n    <h4 class=\"\" data-name=\"The Girls (Gehenu Lamai): New Restoration\" data-datetime=\"Mon 27 Jul 19:30\" data-id=\"25387\"><span style=\"color:#C00;  margin-right: 3px;\" >SOLD OUT</span>&ndash; <a href=\"/login\" title=\"Members – login to add yourself to the waiting list\">Members: login to join waiting list</a></h4>  </div></div></div>              </span>\n          </div>\n\n\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film\" style=\"background-image: url();\" >\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-image\">\n                          <a\n              href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/the-green-ray/\"><img src=\"https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/GCL/5730250.jpg\" class=\"films-list__by-title__film-thumb\" alt=\"\"></a>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-content\">\n            <h2\n              class=\"films-list__by-title__film-title\"><a  href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/the-green-ray/\">The Green Ray <span class=\"film-detail__film__rating\">12A</span></a></h2>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__az-summary\">\n              <em>Éric Rohmer, 1986, France</em></div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__synopsis\">\n                                The Green Ray was suggested by our member Joni Tyler, who writes: 'Help us believe summer is coming by screening Rohmer’s The Green Ray for its 40th anniversary. So evocative, and such a great central character in the exasperating, indecisive Delphine (Marie Riviere.).' Eric&hellip; <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/the-green-ray/\">Read&nbsp;More</a>            </div>\n\n            <span class=\"films-list__by-title__screenings\">\n                  <div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel  \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Thu 30 Jul</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5731135.TcsSection_638\">17:40</a></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n      </div></div></div><div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel  \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Sun 16 Aug</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5731142.TcsSection_3060731\">14:00</a></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n      </div></div></div>              </span>\n          </div>\n\n\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film\" style=\"background-image: url();\" id=\"starts-with-h\">\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-image\">\n                          <a\n              href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/harry-and-the-hendersons/\"><img src=\"https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/GCL/5700934.jpg\" class=\"films-list__by-title__film-thumb\" alt=\"\"></a>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-content\">\n            <h2\n              class=\"films-list__by-title__film-title\"><a  href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/harry-and-the-hendersons/\">Harry and the Hendersons <span class=\"film-detail__film__rating\">PG</span></a></h2>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__az-summary\">\n              <em>William Dear, 1987, USA</em></div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__synopsis\">\n                                Academy Award nominee John Lithgow stars in this big-hearted, big-footed family comedy. While returning from a trip to the woods, George Henderson and his family accidentally run over a friendly Bigfoot-like beast.  \"Harry\" soon awakens and despite their initial fears, Harry turns&hellip; <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/harry-and-the-hendersons/\">Read&nbsp;More</a>            </div>\n\n            <span class=\"films-list__by-title__screenings\">\n                  <div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel   pay_what_you_can \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Sat 26 Sep</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5700957.TcsSection_638\">11:00</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-pay_what_you_can\"></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n      </div></div></div><div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel   pay_what_you_can \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Sun 27 Sep</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5700959.TcsSection_638\">11:00</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-pay_what_you_can\"></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n      </div></div></div>              </span>\n          </div>\n\n\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film\" style=\"background-image: url();\" >\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-image\">\n                          <a\n              href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/his-girl-friday/\"><img src=\"https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/GCL/5390970.jpg\" class=\"films-list__by-title__film-thumb\" alt=\"\"></a>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-content\">\n            <h2\n              class=\"films-list__by-title__film-title\"><a  href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/his-girl-friday/\">His Girl Friday <span class=\"film-detail__film__rating\">U</span></a></h2>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__az-summary\">\n              <em>Howard Hawks, 1940, USA</em></div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__synopsis\">\n                                The screening on Thursday 28 May will be introduced by filmmaker John Gordillo and will followed by a discussion at The Atrium Bar. One of the fastest, funniest, and most quotable films ever made, His Girl Friday stars Rosalind Russell as reporter Hildy&hellip; <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/his-girl-friday/\">Read&nbsp;More</a>            </div>\n\n            <span class=\"films-list__by-title__screenings\">\n                  <div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel  \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Mon 13 Jul</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5414124.TcsSection_638\">15:00</a></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n      </div></div></div>              </span>\n          </div>\n\n\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film\" style=\"background-image: url();\" id=\"starts-with-i\">\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-image\">\n                          <a\n              href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/the-illegal-immigrant-qa/\"><img src=\"https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/GCL/5710617.jpg\" class=\"films-list__by-title__film-thumb\" alt=\"\"></a>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-content\">\n            <h2\n              class=\"films-list__by-title__film-title\"><a  href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/the-illegal-immigrant-qa/\">The Illegal Immigrant <span class=\"film-detail__film__rating\">18</span></a></h2>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__az-summary\">\n              <em>Mabel Cheung, 1985, Hong Kong</em></div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__synopsis\">\n                                The screening on 8 August will be followed by an online Q&A with the director Mabel Cheung. The Illegal Immigrant is the feature debut of Mabel Cheung and the first instalment of her acclaimed 'Migration Trilogy' (along with An Autumn’s Tale and Eight Taels&hellip; <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/the-illegal-immigrant-qa/\">Read&nbsp;More</a>            </div>\n\n            <span class=\"films-list__by-title__screenings\">\n                  <div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel  \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Sat 18 Jul</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5711790.TcsSection_638\">16:00</a></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n      </div></div></div><div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel   q_and_a \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Sat 08 Aug</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5711828.TcsSection_638\">13:00</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-q_and_a\"></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n      </div></div></div>              </span>\n          </div>\n\n\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film\" style=\"background-image: url();\" >\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-image\">\n                          <a\n              href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/the-invite/\"><img src=\"https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/GCL/5730014.jpg\" class=\"films-list__by-title__film-thumb\" alt=\"\"></a>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-content\">\n            <h2\n              class=\"films-list__by-title__film-title\"><a  href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/the-invite/\">The Invite <span class=\"film-detail__film__rating\">15</span></a></h2>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__az-summary\">\n              <em>Olivia Wilde, 2026, USA</em></div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__synopsis\">\n                                Joe and Angela's marriage is on thin ice. When they invite their enigmatic upstairs neighbors for a dinner party, the night spirals into unexpected places. Have they reignited the spark or lit the match that burns it all down? The Garden Cinema&hellip; <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/the-invite/\">Read&nbsp;More</a>            </div>\n\n            <span class=\"films-list__by-title__screenings\">\n                  <div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel   audio_description \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Sat 11 Jul</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5835650.TcsSection_638\">20:45</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-audio_description\"></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n      </div></div></div><div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel   audio_description \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Sun 12 Jul</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5835669.TcsSection_3060731\">19:30</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-audio_description\"></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n      </div></div></div><div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel  \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Mon 13 Jul</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5835679.TcsSection_3060731\">15:15</a></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n      </div></div></div><div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel   audio_description \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Tue 14 Jul</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5835691.TcsSection_3060731\">20:15</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-audio_description\"></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n      </div></div></div><div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel   audio_description \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Wed 15 Jul</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5835705.TcsSection_638\">15:15</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-audio_description\"></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n      </div></div></div>              </span>\n          </div>\n\n\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film\" style=\"background-image: url();\" >\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-image\">\n                          <a\n              href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/ish/\"><img src=\"https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/GCL/5803142.jpg\" class=\"films-list__by-title__film-thumb\" alt=\"\"></a>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-content\">\n            <h2\n              class=\"films-list__by-title__film-title\"><a  href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/ish/\">Ish <span class=\"film-detail__film__rating\">15</span></a></h2>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__az-summary\">\n              <em>Imran Perretta, 2025, UK</em></div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__synopsis\">\n                                Set and filmed in Luton, Ish follows 12-year-old best friends Ish (Farhan Hasnat) and Maram (Yahya Kitana), who wrestle to hold onto their friendship in the wake of a police stop and search. As the ripples take hold, the boys try to make&hellip; <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/ish/\">Read&nbsp;More</a>            </div>\n\n            <span class=\"films-list__by-title__screenings\">\n                  <div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel   q_and_a  audio_description \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Sat 01 Aug</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5803171.TcsSection_3060731\">18:30</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-q_and_a\"></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-audio_description\"></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n      </div></div></div>              </span>\n          </div>\n\n\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film\" style=\"background-image: url();\" >\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-image\">\n                          <a\n              href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/it-happened-one-night-90th-anniversary/\"><img src=\"https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/GCL/1690197.jpg\" class=\"films-list__by-title__film-thumb\" alt=\"\"></a>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-content\">\n            <h2\n              class=\"films-list__by-title__film-title\"><a  href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/it-happened-one-night-90th-anniversary/\">It Happened One Night <span class=\"film-detail__film__rating\">U</span></a></h2>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__az-summary\">\n              <em>Frank Capra, 1934, USA</em></div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__synopsis\">\n                                Released just as the Hays Office was beginning to enforce the Production Code censoring ‘immoral’ movies, Frank Capra’s impish, daring comedy crackles with erotic tension. Claudette Colbert’s runaway heiress meets Clark Gable’s recently fired newspaperman on a night bus from Florida to&hellip; <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/it-happened-one-night-90th-anniversary/\">Read&nbsp;More</a>            </div>\n\n            <span class=\"films-list__by-title__screenings\">\n                  <div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel  \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Sun 26 Jul</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5414188.TcsSection_638\">14:00</a></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n      </div></div></div>              </span>\n          </div>\n\n\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film\" style=\"background-image: url();\" id=\"starts-with-j\">\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-image\">\n                          <a\n              href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/james-and-the-giant-peach/\"><img src=\"https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/GCL/587209.jpg\" class=\"films-list__by-title__film-thumb\" alt=\"\"></a>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-content\">\n            <h2\n              class=\"films-list__by-title__film-title\"><a  href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/james-and-the-giant-peach/\">James and the Giant Peach- 30th anniversary <span class=\"film-detail__film__rating\">U</span></a></h2>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__az-summary\">\n              <em></em></div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__synopsis\">\n                                Join us for the 30th anniversary of James and the Giant Peach. A great opportunity to introduce younger audiences to a classic adaptation of a truly well-loved Roald Dahl story, produced by Tim Burton with amazing stop-motion animation and a stellar cast.&hellip; <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/james-and-the-giant-peach/\">Read&nbsp;More</a>            </div>\n\n            <span class=\"films-list__by-title__screenings\">\n                  <div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel   pay_what_you_can \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Sun 12 Jul</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5525425.TcsSection_3060731\">11:00</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-pay_what_you_can\"></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n      </div></div></div>              </span>\n          </div>\n\n\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film\" style=\"background-image: url();\" >\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-image\">\n                          <a\n              href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/john-the-violent/\"><img src=\"https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/GCL/5599866.jpg\" class=\"films-list__by-title__film-thumb\" alt=\"\"></a>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-content\">\n            <h2\n              class=\"films-list__by-title__film-title\"><a  href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/john-the-violent/\">John the Violent <span class=\"film-detail__film__rating\">18</span></a></h2>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__az-summary\">\n              <em>Tonia Marketaki/ 1973/ Greece</em></div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__synopsis\">\n                                The screening on Thursday 22 October will be introduced by Film Lecturer Tonia Kazakopoulou. Synopsis: It’s midnight on a deserted street in Athens. A young woman is stabbed to death by a stranger, who instantly slips into the shadows. Uppon his arrest,&hellip; <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/john-the-violent/\">Read&nbsp;More</a>            </div>\n\n            <span class=\"films-list__by-title__screenings\">\n                  <div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel   intro \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Thu 22 Oct</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5599893.TcsSection_638\">19:15</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-intro\"></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n      </div></div></div>              </span>\n          </div>\n\n\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film\" style=\"background-image: url();\" >\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-image\">\n                          <a\n              href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/joint-security-area/\"><img src=\"https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/GCL/5730270.jpg\" class=\"films-list__by-title__film-thumb\" alt=\"\"></a>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-content\">\n            <h2\n              class=\"films-list__by-title__film-title\"><a  href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/joint-security-area/\">Joint Security Area <span class=\"film-detail__film__rating\">15</span></a></h2>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__az-summary\">\n              <em>Park Chan-wook, 2000, Korea</em></div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__synopsis\">\n                                Joint Security Area was suggested by our member Yaqi Gao, who writes: 'Joint Security Area (JSA) is not only a gripping mystery thriller, but also an emotional and human story. Directed by Park Chan-wook, the film explores the relationships between North and South Korean&hellip; <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/joint-security-area/\">Read&nbsp;More</a>            </div>\n\n            <span class=\"films-list__by-title__screenings\">\n                  <div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel  \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Thu 23 Jul</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5731085.TcsSection_638\">15:30</a></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n      </div></div></div><div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel  \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Sun 23 Aug</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5731091.TcsSection_3060731\">19:15</a></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n      </div></div></div>              </span>\n          </div>\n\n\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film\" style=\"background-image: url();\" id=\"starts-with-k\">\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-image\">\n                          <a\n              href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/kapodistrias-the-governor/\"><img src=\"https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/GCL/5493427.jpg\" class=\"films-list__by-title__film-thumb\" alt=\"\"></a>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-content\">\n            <h2\n              class=\"films-list__by-title__film-title\"><a  href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/kapodistrias-the-governor/\">Kapodistrias - The Governor <span class=\"film-detail__film__rating\">12A</span></a></h2>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__az-summary\">\n              <em>Yiannis Smaragdis/ 2026/ Greece</em></div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__synopsis\">\n                                Kapodistrias is a historical film set in the early 19th century and tells the true story of Greece’s greatest politician and first Governor, Ioannis Kapodistrias, after the country’s liberation from the Ottoman Empire. With courage, kindness, and dignity, he defends every person’s freedom,&hellip; <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/kapodistrias-the-governor/\">Read&nbsp;More</a>            </div>\n\n            <span class=\"films-list__by-title__screenings\">\n                  <div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel  \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Wed 15 Jul</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5734162.TcsSection_3060731\">20:20</a></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n      </div></div></div><div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel  \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Sun 19 Jul</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5839470.TcsSection_3060731\">16:30</a></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n      </div></div></div>              </span>\n          </div>\n\n\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film\" style=\"background-image: url();\" >\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-image\">\n                          <a\n              href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/klute/\"><img src=\"https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/GCL/5710824.jpg\" class=\"films-list__by-title__film-thumb\" alt=\"\"></a>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-content\">\n            <h2\n              class=\"films-list__by-title__film-title\"><a  href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/klute/\">Klute <span class=\"film-detail__film__rating\">15</span></a></h2>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__az-summary\">\n              <em>Alan J. Pakula/ 1971/ USA</em></div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__synopsis\">\n                                Klute was suggested by our member Colin Marsh, who writes: 'Alan J Pakula’s memorably atmospheric 1971 thriller starring Donald Sutherland and a stunning Best Actress Oscar performance from the wonderful Jane Fonda in the unforgettable role of Bree Daniels..' With her Oscar-winning turn&hellip; <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/klute/\">Read&nbsp;More</a>            </div>\n\n            <span class=\"films-list__by-title__screenings\">\n                  <div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel  \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Sat 01 Aug</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5731148.TcsSection_638\">18:00</a></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n      </div></div></div><div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel  \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Mon 31 Aug</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5731154.TcsSection_638\">15:30</a></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n      </div></div></div>              </span>\n          </div>\n\n\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film\" style=\"background-image: url();\" >\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-image\">\n                          <a\n              href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/kokuho/\"><img src=\"https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/GCL/5493728.jpg\" class=\"films-list__by-title__film-thumb\" alt=\"\"></a>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-content\">\n            <h2\n              class=\"films-list__by-title__film-title\"><a  href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/kokuho/\">Kokuho <span class=\"film-detail__film__rating\">15</span></a></h2>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__az-summary\">\n              <em>Lee Sang-il, 2025, Japan</em></div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__synopsis\">\n                                After the death of his father, the leader of a yakuza gang, fourteen-year-old Kikuo is taken in by a renowned Kabuki actor and introduced to the demanding world of traditional theatre. Growing up alongside Shunsuke, the actor’s only son, the two boys&hellip; <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/kokuho/\">Read&nbsp;More</a>            </div>\n\n            <span class=\"films-list__by-title__screenings\">\n                  <div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel  \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Sun 12 Jul</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5835677.TcsSection_971\">12:45</a></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n      </div></div></div>              </span>\n          </div>\n\n\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film\" style=\"background-image: url();\" >\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-image\">\n                          <a\n              href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/koln-75/\"><img src=\"https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/GCL/5572489.jpg\" class=\"films-list__by-title__film-thumb\" alt=\"\"></a>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-content\">\n            <h2\n              class=\"films-list__by-title__film-title\"><a  href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/koln-75/\">Köln 75 <span class=\"film-detail__film__rating\">15</span></a></h2>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__az-summary\">\n              <em>Ido Fluk, 2025, Germany, Poland, Belgium</em></div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__synopsis\">\n                                Keith Jarrett’s iconic January 1975 performance nearly never happened. Based on a true story, Köln 75 follows the young, driven concert promoter Vera Brandes as she conceives and organises the event against all odds. From securing the venue and selling tickets to&hellip; <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/koln-75/\">Read&nbsp;More</a>            </div>\n\n            <span class=\"films-list__by-title__screenings\">\n                  <div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel  \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Tue 14 Jul</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5835687.TcsSection_971\">15:30</a></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n      </div></div></div>              </span>\n          </div>\n\n\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film\" style=\"background-image: url();\" id=\"starts-with-l\">\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-image\">\n                          <a\n              href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/la-parra/\"><img src=\"https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/GCL/5745433.jpg\" class=\"films-list__by-title__film-thumb\" alt=\"\"></a>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-content\">\n            <h2\n              class=\"films-list__by-title__film-title\"><a  href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/la-parra/\">La Parra <span class=\"film-detail__film__rating\">12</span></a></h2>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__az-summary\">\n              <em>Alberto Gracia, 2023, Spain</em></div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__synopsis\">\n                                La parra is the third feature film by Alberto Gracia. It is a game of mirrors, a story that blends the social and the fantastical, portraying Ferrol as a spectral place—a kind of ghostly island where nothing seems real, yet everything is rooted&hellip; <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/la-parra/\">Read&nbsp;More</a>            </div>\n\n            <span class=\"films-list__by-title__screenings\">\n                  <div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel  \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Fri 17 Jul</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5767961.TcsSection_3060731\">18:15</a></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n      </div></div></div>              </span>\n          </div>\n\n\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film\" style=\"background-image: url();\" >\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-image\">\n                          <a\n              href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/labyrinth/\"><img src=\"https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/GCL/5525634.jpg\" class=\"films-list__by-title__film-thumb\" alt=\"\"></a>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-content\">\n            <h2\n              class=\"films-list__by-title__film-title\"><a  href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/labyrinth/\">Labyrinth- 40th anniversary <span class=\"film-detail__film__rating\">U</span></a></h2>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__az-summary\">\n              <em></em></div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__synopsis\">\n                                Celebrate the 40th anniversary of Jim Henson cult fantasy fairy tale Labyrinth. Sarah (Jennifer Connelly) races against time to navigate the mysterious Labyrinth and rescue her baby brother from David Bowie’s menacing Goblin King. Given just 13 hours to solve its puzzles&hellip; <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/labyrinth/\">Read&nbsp;More</a>            </div>\n\n            <span class=\"films-list__by-title__screenings\">\n                  <div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel   pay_what_you_can \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Sat 01 Aug</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5525470.TcsSection_3060731\">11:00</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-pay_what_you_can\"></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n      </div></div></div><div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel   pay_what_you_can \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Sun 02 Aug</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5525477.TcsSection_3060731\">11:00</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-pay_what_you_can\"></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n      </div></div></div><div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel   pay_what_you_can \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Wed 05 Aug</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5525480.TcsSection_971\">14:45</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-pay_what_you_can\"></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n      </div></div></div>              </span>\n          </div>\n\n\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film\" style=\"background-image: url();\" >\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-image\">\n                          <a\n              href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/the-lady-eve/\"><img src=\"https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/GCL/5391217.jpg\" class=\"films-list__by-title__film-thumb\" alt=\"\"></a>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-content\">\n            <h2\n              class=\"films-list__by-title__film-title\"><a  href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/the-lady-eve/\">The Lady Eve <span class=\"film-detail__film__rating\">U</span></a></h2>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__az-summary\">\n              <em>Preston Sturges, 1941, USA</em></div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__synopsis\">\n                                Better remembered for intense dramatic roles, Barbara Stanwyck and Henry Fonda weren’t obvious choices for light romantic comedy, but they’re nicely matched in this Preston Sturges classic. Stanwyck is the card sharp who sets out to fleece earnest, accident-prone millionaire 'ophiologist' (snake&hellip; <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/the-lady-eve/\">Read&nbsp;More</a>            </div>\n\n            <span class=\"films-list__by-title__screenings\">\n                  <div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel  \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Sun 02 Aug</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5414216.TcsSection_638\">17:00</a></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n      </div></div></div>              </span>\n          </div>\n\n\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film\" style=\"background-image: url();\" >\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-image\">\n                          <a\n              href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/the-last-one-for-the-road/\"><img src=\"https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/GCL/5771040.jpg\" class=\"films-list__by-title__film-thumb\" alt=\"\"></a>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-content\">\n            <h2\n              class=\"films-list__by-title__film-title\"><a  href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/the-last-one-for-the-road/\">The Last One for the Road <span class=\"film-detail__film__rating\">15</span></a></h2>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__az-summary\">\n              <em>Francesco Sossai, 2025, Italy, Germany</em></div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__synopsis\">\n                                Carlobianchi and Doriano, two broke, rogue-ish fifty-somethings with a ‘never skip the last drink’ philosophy, meet Giulio, a shy architecture student adrift in life. What starts as a chance encounter turns into a chaotic road trip through the Venetian plains - where&hellip; <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/the-last-one-for-the-road/\">Read&nbsp;More</a>            </div>\n\n            <span class=\"films-list__by-title__screenings\">\n                  <div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel  \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Sat 11 Jul</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5771048.TcsSection_3060731\">20:15</a></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n      </div></div></div><div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel  \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Sun 12 Jul</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5771050.TcsSection_638\">17:00</a></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n      </div></div></div><div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel  \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Mon 13 Jul</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardenc