_971\">11:00</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-pay_what_you_can\"></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n      </div></div></div>              </span>\n          </div>\n\n\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film\" style=\"background-image: url();\" >\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-image\">\n                          <a\n              href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/the-london-international-animation-festival-presents-8-astonishing-animated-shorts-for-4-12-year-o/\"><img src=\"https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/GCL/5736269.png\" class=\"films-list__by-title__film-thumb\" alt=\"\"></a>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-content\">\n            <h2\n              class=\"films-list__by-title__film-title\"><a  href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/the-london-international-animation-festival-presents-8-astonishing-animated-shorts-for-4-12-year-o/\">The London International Animation Festival presents 8  Astonishing Animated Shorts for ages 4+ <span class=\"film-detail__film__rating\">U</span></a></h2>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__az-summary\">\n              <em>Various Directors, Various Years, Various Countries</em></div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__synopsis\">\n                                Like childhood, animation is full of wonder and simple pleasures. This carefully chosen programme for our littlest and most special audience contains 8 of the best, wonderful short animated films, full of joy, from all around the world. There’ll be talking animals,&hellip; <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/the-london-international-animation-festival-presents-8-astonishing-animated-shorts-for-4-12-year-o/\">Read&nbsp;More</a>            </div>\n\n            <span class=\"films-list__by-title__screenings\">\n                  <div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel   pay_what_you_can \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Sat 29 Aug</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5736826.TcsSection_3060731\">11:00</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-pay_what_you_can\"></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n      </div></div></div><div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel   pay_what_you_can \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Sun 30 Aug</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5736828.TcsSection_3060731\">11:00</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-pay_what_you_can\"></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n      </div></div></div><div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel   pay_what_you_can \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Mon 31 Aug</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5736830.TcsSection_3060731\">11:00</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-pay_what_you_can\"></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n      </div></div></div>              </span>\n          </div>\n\n\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film\" style=\"background-image: url();\" id=\"starts-with-m\">\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-image\">\n                          <a\n              href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/made-in-hong-kong-2/\"><img src=\"https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/GCL/5711511.jpg\" class=\"films-list__by-title__film-thumb\" alt=\"\"></a>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-content\">\n            <h2\n              class=\"films-list__by-title__film-title\"><a  href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/made-in-hong-kong-2/\">Made in Hong Kong <span class=\"film-detail__film__rating\">15</span></a></h2>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__az-summary\">\n              <em>Fruit Chan, 1997, Hong Kong</em></div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__synopsis\">\n                                The screening on 19 August will be introduced by James Mudge, the Festival Director of Focus Hong Kong. Presented in the restored version. Made in Hong Kong is the breakthrough work of Hong Kong auteur Fruit Chan and the first instalment of his&hellip; <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/made-in-hong-kong-2/\">Read&nbsp;More</a>            </div>\n\n            <span class=\"films-list__by-title__screenings\">\n                  <div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel  \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Mon 13 Jul</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5713122.TcsSection_638\">20:00</a></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n      </div></div></div><div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel   intro \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Wed 19 Aug</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5713169.TcsSection_3060731\">18:00</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-intro\"></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n      </div></div></div>              </span>\n          </div>\n\n\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film\" style=\"background-image: url();\" >\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-image\">\n                          <a\n              href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/midnight/\"><img src=\"https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/GCL/5390536.jpg\" class=\"films-list__by-title__film-thumb\" alt=\"\"></a>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-content\">\n            <h2\n              class=\"films-list__by-title__film-title\"><a  href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/midnight/\">Midnight <span class=\"film-detail__film__rating\">U</span></a></h2>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__az-summary\">\n              <em>Mitchell Leisen, 1939, USA</em></div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__synopsis\">\n                                The matinee screening on Wednesday 24 June, will be introduced by journalist Darren Richman. Screwball comedy doesn’t get any more effortlessly elegant and gleefully irreverent than this roulette wheel of romantic deception, gleaming with cunning wit and Continental élan. A couture-clad Claudette&hellip; <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/midnight/\">Read&nbsp;More</a>            </div>\n\n            <span class=\"films-list__by-title__screenings\">\n                  <div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel  \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Fri 24 Jul</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5414182.TcsSection_638\">18:00</a></span>  <div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\">\n      </div></div></div>              </span>\n          </div>\n\n\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film\" style=\"background-image: url();\" >\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-image\">\n                          <a\n              href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/monsieur-hulots-holiday/\"><img width=\"400\" height=\"600\" src=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/films/Monsieur-Hulot-s-Holiday.jpg\" class=\"films-list__by-title__film-thumb\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/films/Monsieur-Hulot-s-Holiday.jpg 400w, https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/films/Monsieur-Hulot-s-Holiday-368x552.jpg 368w, https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/films/Monsieur-Hulot-s-Holiday-200x300.jpg 200w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 400px) 100vw, 400px\" /></a>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-content\">\n            <h2\n              class=\"films-list__by-title__film-title\"><a  href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/monsieur-hulots-holiday/\">Monsieur Hulot's Holiday <span class=\"film-detail__film__rating\">U</span></a></h2>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__az-summary\">\n              <em>Jacques Tati, 1953, France</em></div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__synopsis\">\n                                Summer holidays at The Garden Cinema would not be complete without Monsieur Hulot. Jacques Tati’s endearing clown, takes a holiday at a seaside resort, where his presence provokes one catastrophe after another. Tati’s masterpiece of gentle slapstick is a series of effortlessly&hellip; <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/monsieur-hulots-holiday/\">Read&nbsp;More</a>            </div>\n\n            <span class=\"films-list__by-title__screenings\">\n                  <div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel   pay_what_you_can \"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Sat 22 Aug</div><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_