llian Crawford</a></h2>\n        <div class=\"films-list__by-event__event__date\">Sat 08 Aug 2026</div>\n\n\n                  <div class=\"synopsis-wrapper\">\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-event__synopsis\">\n                                              Celebrate the publication of Lillian Crawford’s exploration of Doctor Who’s appeal to the neurodivergent community with a screening of Daleks’ Invasion&hellip;\n\n              </div>\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-event__button\"><a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/daleks-invasion-earth-2150-a-d-1966-introduction-and-book-signing-by-lillian-crawford/\">Read&nbsp;more</a></div>\n        </div>\n\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n  </div>\n      <div class=\"films-list__by-event__event\">\n    <div class=\"films-list__by-event__event__inner\">\n\n      <div class=\"films-list__by-event__event__image-block\">\n        <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/summer-school-2001/\">\n                        <img src=\"https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/GCL/5768280.jpg\" class=\"films-list__by-event__event__image middle\" alt=\"\"></a>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"films-list__by-event__event__content-block\">\n        <span class=\"films-list__by-event__event__pre-title\">EVENT: </span>\n        <h2 class=\"films-list__by-event__event__title\"><a\n            href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/summer-school-2001/\">Summer School, 2001</a></h2>\n        <div class=\"films-list__by-event__event__date\">Mon 17 Aug 2026</div>\n\n\n                  <div class=\"synopsis-wrapper\">\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-event__synopsis\">\n                                              The first Czech-Vietnamese feature film, Summer School, 2001 is a tender and deeply personal coming-of-age story exploring family, identity and belonging across&hellip;\n\n              </div>\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-event__button\"><a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/summer-school-2001/\">Read&nbsp;more</a></div>\n        </div>\n\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n  </div>\n      <div class=\"films-list__by-event__event\">\n    <div class=\"films-list__by-event__event__inner\">\n\n      <div class=\"films-list__by-event__event__image-block\">\n        <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/panel-what-is-the-hong-kong-golden-age-cinema/\">\n                        <img src=\"https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/GCL/5783063.jpg\" class=\"films-list__by-event__event__image middle\" alt=\"\"></a>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"films-list__by-event__event__content-block\">\n        <span class=\"films-list__by-event__event__pre-title\">EVENT: </span>\n        <h2 class=\"films-list__by-event__event__title\"><a\n            href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/panel-what-is-the-hong-kong-golden-age-cinema/\">Panel: What is Hong Kong Golden Age Cinema?</a></h2>\n        <div class=\"films-list__by-event__event__date\">Wed 19 Aug 2026</div>\n\n\n                  <div class=\"synopsis-wrapper\">\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-event__synopsis\">\n                                              Hong Kong cinema’s Golden Age was a remarkable period spanning the late 1970s to the 1990s, during which the territory emerged&hellip;\n\n              </div>\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-event__button\"><a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/panel-what-is-the-hong-kong-golden-age-cinema/\">Read&nbsp;more</a></div>\n        </div>\n\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n  </div>\n      <div class=\"films-list__by-event__event\">\n    <div class=\"films-list__by-event__event__inner\">\n\n      <div class=\"films-list__by-event__event__image-block\">\n        <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/festival/celebrating-75-years-of-contemporary-films/\">\n                      <img src=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/images.png\" loading=\"lazy\"\n               class=\"films-list__by-event__event__image middle\"></a>\n                </div>\n\n      <div class=\"films-list__by-event__event__content-block\">\n        <span class=\"films-list__by-event__event__pre-title\">FESTIVAL: </span>\n        <h2 class=\"films-list__by-event__event__title\"><a\n            href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/festival/celebrating-75-years-of-contemporary-films/\">Celebrating 75 Years of Contemporary Films</a></h2>\n        <div class=\"films-list__by-event__event__date\"> Sat 12 Sep\n              &#8212;  Sat 26 Sep 2026</div>\n        <div class=\"synopsis-wrapper\">\n\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-event__synopsis\">\n                                              Bringing bold cinema that inspired generations of British audiences and filmmakers — a festival of screening events with special guests across London this&hellip; </div>\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-event__button\"><a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/festival/celebrating-75-years-of-contemporary-films/\">Read&nbsp;more</a>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n  </div>\n    </div>\n        </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n\n \n\n\n \n\n <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://sibforms.com/forms/end-form/build/sib-styles.css\">\n<a name=\"newsletter\"></a>\n<section class=\"newsletter\">\n\t <div class=\"newsletter__inner\">\n\t\t\t \n\t\t\t\t<h1 class=\"newsletter__title\">Join our newsletter</h1>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"newsletter__text\">Sign up to receive weekly updates on upcoming screenings and events at The Garden Cinema.</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t<!-- Begin Brevo Signup Form -->\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t <form id=\"sib-form\" method=\"POST\" action=\"https://ba73d263.sibforms.com/serve/MUIFAMLHxHbXZg-GRRWqz2v38uMI1o8ij6ON4Dfa-68hvYivWzK0kaf7aUH8x8QhIS-KYzssUGgDA-WiauNPoig9BUw-uqeI6AlXY-iR2Vu0Njb3zYHCze3pbDSk319mteKkKJLa5QChf-zWmpe8Ol2qWutFgTAb_f3kyYjMzW0lCsulE5ipW3GK1Hhg5P1fSs6_7xIxHYkGh9lB_A==\" class=\"newsletter__form\" style=\"te